atom     containers/one-arg-spreads
source   generated
gen      gen/containers.raku
law      [{X}].elems  ===  ({X}).elems
why      a lone container argument spreads, so the literal has its elements
ladder   14 spellings

- id     0001
  from   law:one-arg-spreads · bug:rakupp-single-hash-does-not-spread
  cell   1
  code   do { my %h = :a(1); my @a = 1, 2, 3; my $s = (1, 2, 3); [1].elems }
  same-as do { my %h = :a(1); my @a = 1, 2, 3; my $s = (1, 2, 3); (1).elems }

